SUMMARY:Public Meeting re Stephenson Avenue pedestrian connection to Danforth GO
DESCRIPTION:Led by organizer Dan Balcaban\, the meeting will provide updates on a residents’ petition for a direct sidewalk path from Stephenson Ave. to the Danforth GO platform\, running alongside the renovated Hydro One transmission station. The meeting will include a Q&A. \nSee the resident petition here: https://www.openpetition.org/ca/petition/online/safer-access-to-danforth-go-build-a-sidewalk-path-from-stephenson-ave. \nRSVP: infocareaboutus@gmail.com or https://forms.gle/xRYv55pV46L3zLiEA
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/public-meeting-re-stephenson-avenue-pedestrian-connection-to-danforth-go/
LOCATION:Comedy Bar Danforth\, 2800 Danforth\, Toronto\, M4C1M1
END:VEVENT
