SUMMARY:Mark Battenberg Music presents The River of Life
DESCRIPTION:Mark Battenberg Music presents The River of Life: A special presentation of the eclectic chamber music of Beaches composer and guitarist Mark Battenberg. The evening will be a celebration of intricate melodies and rich harmonies as you embark on your musical journey along the mysterious River of Life. The concert will feature Cellist Sybil Shanahan\, violinist Alex Cheung and Shakuhachi flute Master Debbie Danbrook. Admission is $20 or pay what you can.
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/mark-battenberg-music-presents-the-river-of-life/
LOCATION:Danforth Mennonite Church\, 2174 Danforth Ave.\, Toronto
END:VEVENT
