SUMMARY:DECA's Danforth East Community Yard Sale!
DESCRIPTION:Back for it’s 12th year\, the DECA Danforth East Community Yard Sale is one of the biggest in the city – last year there were over 200 sales registered! There is an interactive map where you can register your sale\, and items you are selling – and bargain hunters can use the map to plot out their yard sale route! There is also a multi seller site at 200 Wolverleigh for those without yards\, and DECA will be collecting specific clothing and small kitchen items for donation to local community organization.
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/decas-danforth-east-community-yard-sale/
END:VEVENT
